#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2336
msgid ""
"The file format is a zip archive containing several text and XML elements: a"
" <filename>mimetype</filename> file giving the mime type, a "
"<filename>content.xml</filename> file with the contents of the spreadsheet "
"cells, and several other files with meta data, style definitions or "
"information on the settings. The file contents can be extracted with the "
"<application>unzip</application> command line program or with any of a "
"number of graphical interface programs."
msgstr ""
"Filformatet är ett ZIP-arkiv som innehåller textfiler och XML-filer: filen "
"<filename>mimetype</filename> anger MIME-typen, filen "
"<filename>content.xml</filename> innehåller kalkylbladets celler och andra "
"filer innehåller metadata, formatmallar och inställningar. Du kan packa upp "
"filinnehållet med kommandoradsprogrammet <application>unzip</application> "
"eller med något av flera grafiska verktyg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2348
msgid ""
"The Organization for the Advancement of Structured Information Standards "
"(OASIS) has accepted this file format as the standard \"OASIS Open Office "
"XML Format\". The published specification for the file format is available "
"from the <ulink type=\"http\" url=\"http://www.oasis-"
"open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=office\"> OASIS Open Office XML "
"Format Technical Committee</ulink> web page. Other information is available "
"from the <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://xml.openoffice.org/\">OpenOffice.org XML File Format</ulink> "
"web page, part of the OpenOffice.org project."
msgstr ""
"Organization for the Advancement of Structured Information Standards (OASIS)"
" har antagit filformatet som standarden ”OASIS Open Office XML Format”. Den "
"publicerade specifikationen finns på webbsidan för <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://www.oasis-"
"open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=office\">OASIS Open Office XML "
"Format Technical Committee</ulink>. Mer information finns även på webbsidan "
"<ulink type=\"http\" url=\"http://xml.openoffice.org/\">OpenOffice.org XML "
"File Format</ulink>, som ingår i OpenOffice.org-projektet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2363
msgid ""
"Version 1.0 of ODF was adopted as an international standard by ISO/IEC as "
"ISO/IEC 26300:2006."
msgstr ""
"ISO/IEC antog version 1.0 av ODF som internationell standard ISO/IEC "
"26300:2006."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2376
msgid ""
"Files in this format can be imported and modified by many different programs"
" including the <application>OpenOffice.org Calc</application> and "
"<application>LibreOffice Calc</application> spreadsheets or may be modified "
"through XML processing."
msgstr ""
"Många program kan importera och ändra filer i det här formatet, bland annat "
"kalkylprogrammen <application>OpenOffice.org Calc</application> och "
"<application>LibreOffice Calc</application>. Det går även att ändra filerna "
"genom XML-bearbetning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2391
msgid "OpenOffice.org Old File Format"
msgstr "OpenOffice.orgs äldre filformat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2393
msgid ""
"OpenOffice.org originally shipped with a file format that has served as a "
"basis for the new OASIS-standardized file format. This file format is "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""
"OpenOffice.org använde ursprungligen ett filformat som blev grunden för det "
"nya OASIS-standardiserade formatet. Det äldre formatet är föråldrat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2399
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can both open and save files in this "
"format and plans to continue to support this format in the future."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan både öppna och spara filer i det här"
" formatet och planerar att fortsätta stödja det."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2411
msgid "OpenOffice.org/StarOffice file format"
msgstr "Filformatet OpenOffice.org/StarOffice"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2423
msgid ""
"<application>OpenOffice.org Calc</application>, "
"<application>StarCalc</application>"
msgstr ""
"<application>OpenOffice.org Calc</application>, "
"<application>StarCalc</application>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2465
msgid "This file format is deprecated and is not widely used."
msgstr ""
"Det här filformatet är föråldrat och används inte i någon större "
"utsträckning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2485
msgid "Plan Perfect File Format"
msgstr "Filformatet Plan Perfect"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2487
msgid ""
"The Plan Perfect file format is a format used by the "
"<application>PlanPerfect</application> spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Plan Perfect är filformatet som används av kalkylprogrammet "
"<application>PlanPerfect</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2499
msgid "Plan Perfect"
msgstr "Plan Perfect"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2511
msgid "<application>PlanPerfect</application>."
msgstr "<application>PlanPerfect</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2541
msgid "Supported by the 'Plan Perfect' plug-in."
msgstr "Stöds av insticksmodulen ’Plan Perfect’."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2584
msgid "PostScript File Format"
msgstr "Filformatet PostScript"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2586
msgid ""
"The PostScript file format is a text format which contains the program code "
"for a postScript interpreter. PostScript is a page description language "
"designed to enable the creation and transfer of printer-ready output."
msgstr ""
"PostScript är ett textformat som innehåller programkod för en PostScript-"
"tolk. PostScript är ett sidbeskrivningsspråk som utformats för att skapa och"
" överföra utskriftsklara dokument."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2594
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> supports the creation of PostScript "
"files through the printing interface, not through the file save mechanism. "
"See <xref linkend=\"chapter-printing\"/>, for details on how to generate a "
"PostScript file."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan skapa PostScript-filer via "
"utskriftsgränssnittet, inte genom funktionen för att spara filer. I <xref "
"linkend=\"chapter-printing\"/> beskrivs hur du skapar en PostScript-fil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2610
msgid "PostScript"
msgstr "PostScript"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2622
msgid ""
"Many programs can interpret and display PostScript files including: "
"<application>GGV</application>, <application>ghostview</application> "
"(<application>gv</application>), and <application>ghostscript</application>."
msgstr ""
"Många program kan tolka och visa PostScript-filer, bland annat: "
"<application>GGV</application>, <application>ghostview</application> "
"(<application>gv</application>) och <application>ghostscript</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2656
msgid ""
"The creation of PostScript files is supported internally by the printing "
"sub-system."
msgstr "Utskriftssystemet har inbyggt stöd för att skapa PostScript-filer."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2668
msgid ""
"The PostScript language was created by Adobe, Inc. The Adobe web site has a "
"non-technical <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://www.adobe.com/products/postscript/main.html\">introduction</ulink>,"
" as well as a technical <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://www.adobe.com/products/postscript/overview.html\">overview</ulink>"
" and the actual <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://partners.adobe.com/asn/tech/ps/specifications.jsp\">specifications</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Adobe, Inc. skapade PostScript-språket. På Adobes webbplats finns en <ulink "
"type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://www.adobe.com/products/postscript/main.html\">introduktion</ulink>"
" utan tekniska detaljer, en teknisk <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://www.adobe.com/products/postscript/overview.html\">översikt</ulink>"
" och själva <ulink type=\"http\" "
"url=\"http://partners.adobe.com/asn/tech/ps/specifications.jsp\">specifikationen</ulink>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2685
msgid ""
"PostScript files can imported into other documents by several programs. For "
"the very advanced, PostScript files can be reprogrammed using a text editor."
msgstr ""
"Flera program kan importera PostScript-filer till andra dokument. Avancerade"
" användare kan även ändra PostScript-filer med en textredigerare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2708
msgid "Portable Document Format (PDF) File Format"
msgstr "Filformatet Portable Document Format (PDF)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2710
msgid ""
"The Portable Document Format (PDF) file format is a binary format which "
"contains page description primitives and combines a subset of the Postscript"
" language with some more recent features. The Portable Document Format is a "
"page description language designed to enable the creation and transfer of "
"printer-ready output."
msgstr ""
"Portable Document Format (PDF) är ett binärformat med "
"sidbeskrivningsinstruktioner. Det innehåller en delmängd av PostScript-"
"språket samt vissa nyare funktioner. PDF är ett sidbeskrivningsspråk för att"
" skapa och överföra utskriftsklara dokument."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2720
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> supports the creation of PDF files "
"through the printing interface, not through the file save mechanism. See "
"<xref linkend=\"chapter-printing\"/>, for details on how to generate a PDF "
"file."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan skapa PDF-filer via "
"utskriftsgränssnittet, inte genom funktionen för att spara filer. I <xref "
"linkend=\"chapter-printing\"/> beskrivs hur du skapar en PDF-fil."
